    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Overview\r\n\r\nKeller Williams Ireland are thrilled to present No. 41 Cill Cais—an imposing, double-fronted 5-bedroom executive family home featuring a cobblelocked driveway, brand-new double-glazed windows throughout, a light-filled attic conversion with twin Velux windows, 2 recently refurbished upstairs bathrooms, and an extra-large side and rear garden in mature Old Bawn.\r\n\r\nDescription\r\n\r\nKeller Williams Ireland are proud to bring No. 41 Cill Cais to the Dublin 24 market. Commanding a prominent, double-fronted position on an extra-large corner-style plot, this exceptionally spacious residence offers an incredible amount of versatile living space, making it the ideal forever home for a growing family.\r\n\r\nStepping through the front door, the ground floor is finished with warm, durable wooden flooring throughout the hallway and reception rooms. The accommodation is designed with modern family living in mind, featuring a dedicated downstairs playroom/office—ideal for remote work or younger kids. The dual-aspect main living room centers around a striking feature fireplace, with double doors opening directly out to the rear garden for seamless summer entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the home is a spacious kitchen paired with a separate, highly practical utility room, both fitted with low-maintenance tiled flooring. The property has been significantly upgraded with brand-new double-glazed windows fitted throughout the entire house, paired with Gas-Fired Central Heating (GFCH) to ensure excellent thermal efficiency, acoustic insulation, and year-round comfort.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the first floor accommodates generous bedrooms and 2 recently refurbished, high-spec bathrooms finished with modern sanitary ware and stylish tiling. Rising to the top level, the substantial attic conversion is flooded with natural light via twin Velux windows, providing an exceptionally bright, multi-use space perfect as a master retreat, teenage lounge, or executive home office.\r\n\r\nOutdoors, the home impresses from the moment you arrive with an attractive, newly installed cobblelocked driveway providing expansive off-street parking. To the side and rear lies an extra-large garden—a massive, private outdoor space offering endless scope for children to play, garden pods, or further extension (subject to planning permission).\r\n\r\nCill Cais is a peaceful, established cul-de-sac enclave just moments from local schools, shopping at Old Bawn and The Square, and scenic walks through Dodder Valley Park. Commuters benefit from direct Luas Red Line connectivity, frequent bus routes, and immediate access to the M50 motorway.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing with Keller Williams Ireland is strongly advised."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation Summary\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway: Wooden flooring, leading to all main downstairs accommodation.\r\n\r\nLiving Room: Dual-aspect reception room featuring warm wood floors, a feature fireplace, and double patio doors to the garden.\r\n\r\nPlayroom / Home Office: Bright downstairs room offering flexible multi-use potential.\r\n\r\nKitchen: Fully fitted kitchen area with easy-clean tiled flooring.\r\n\r\nUtility Room: Separate tiled utility space for laundry and extra storage.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor Bedrooms: Generous bedroom layout with built-in wardrobe options.\r\n\r\nUpstairs Bathrooms: 2 newly refurbished, contemporary bathrooms fitted with modern sanitary ware and tiling.\r\n\r\nAttic Conversion: Fully converted top floor with twin Velux windows and eaves storage.\r\n\r\nExterior: Generous cobble locked front driveway; exceptional, private side and rear lawned/paved garden.\r\n\r\nBER Details\r\n\r\nBER: Pending (Currently being prepared)"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Key Features\r\n\r\nDouble-Fronted Kerb Appeal: Eye-catching facade with a newly installed cobblelocked driveway.\r\n\r\nUpgraded Glazing: Brand-new double-glazed windows fitted throughout the property.\r\n\r\n2 Refurbished Bathrooms: Both upstairs bathrooms recently updated with contemporary sanitary ware and luxury tiling.\r\n\r\nSunlit Attic Conversion: Substantial converted top floor featuring twin Velux windows for maximum light.\r\n\r\nGround Floor Layout: Dedicated playroom/office, separate utility room, and wooden flooring throughout reception areas.\r\n\r\nFeature Living Room: Cozy fireplace with double doors opening directly onto the rear garden.\r\n\r\nExtra-Large Plot: Substantial side and rear gardens offering privacy and extension potential (SPP).\r\n\r\nPrime Old Bawn Location: Quiet cul-de-sac setting close to Dodder Valley Park, top schools, and the M50."
      },
